vfs.is_dir(): path must be a string, got none
vfs.write(): path must be a string, got list
vfs.append(): path must be a string, got float
vfs.remove(): path must be a string, got bool
vfs.remove_tree(): path must be a string, got none
vfs.size(): path must be a string, got int
vfs.entries(): path must be a string, got int
